  { title: '视频加载与取消', href: '/factory/?ui-state=video-loading', action: '查看加载中反馈，点击 Cancel loading，再正常播放。', result: '取消后回到可播放状态，不影响同页其他录像和采购资料。' },
];
---
<BaseLayout title="Interaction preview | HAN XING" description="Local interaction states and prototype walkthrough." noindex>
  <section class="section"><div class="container interaction-preview-guide">
    <h1>交互原型与状态清单</h1>
    <p class="lead">沿用现有品牌色、导航层级和内容，补全可操作状态。</p>
    <p>这是本地开发验收入口，不加入网站导航。带 <code>ui-state</code> 的链接用于演示异常；表单演示使用虚构信息，没有发送询盘。</p>
    <div class="interaction-preview-rules"><h2>共用交互规则</h2><ul><li>状态反馈放在操作发生的位置，错误保留到修复或重试。</li><li>本地筛选和草稿生成即时完成；图片慢载才显示加载提示，不增加人为等待。</li><li>键盘焦点可见；Esc 关闭查看器和菜单；弹窗关闭后回到原入口。</li><li>修改已生成草稿时保留原文，先更新再复制或打开；真实发送仍由邮件或 WhatsApp 应用完成。</li><li>手机菜单可独立滚动，表格保留横向滚动；图片弹窗适配短屏；支持 reduced motion。</li></ul></div>
    <div class="interaction-preview-list">{states.map((state, index) => <article><div><span class="interaction-preview-number">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span><h2>{state.title}</h2></div><p>{state.action}</p><p class="interaction-preview-result">预期：{state.result}</p><a class="button secondary" href={state.href}>体验此状态</a></article>)}</div>
    <p class="interaction-preview-footnote">桌面建议 1440 × 900；手机验收 390 × 844，并覆盖 320px 窄屏与横屏短视口。此页与异常演示入口仅在开发模式开放，生产构建不提供本页。</p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .interaction-preview-guide { max-width:1080px; }
  .interaction-preview-guide > p { max-width:74ch; }
  .interaction-preview-rules { margin:32px 0; padding:24px; border:1px solid #ccc; }
  .interaction-preview-rules h2 { font-size:24px; }
  .interaction-preview-rules ul { margin:0; }
  .interaction-preview-list { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:0 32px; }
  .interaction-preview-list article { padding:28px 0; border-top:1px solid #ccc; }
  .interaction-preview-list article > div { display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:12px; }
  .interaction-preview-list h2 { font-size:22px; margin:0 0 14px; }
  .interaction-preview-number { font-size:13px; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }
  .interaction-preview-list p { font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; }
  .interaction-preview-result { color:#555; }
  .interaction-preview-footnote { margin-top:32px; font-size:14px; }
  @media(max-width:700px) { .interaction-preview-list { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .interaction-preview-rules { padding:18px; } }
</style>
